  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4654c6cc80f425e4686c73c171c268d6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: 'Using the Setup Helpers the button can be setup with it''s upper and lower
    physics limits, as well as it''s pressed and unpresseed positions.


    The
    spring and damper will need to be adjusted based on how stiff you want the button
    to be, being mindful of the mass ratios involved. The button here was set to
    10 mass to keep the joints stable.


    The ButtonDown event is hooked up to
    a component on the small_case_window to open it up when pressed'
